cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this tool, please cite it as below, and also cite the Open-LUT paper it is based on."
title: "SG13G2 gm/ID Lookup: interactive gm/ID lookup tables for the IHP SG13G2 open PDK"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Uludağ"
    given-names: "Hidayet Eren"
    affiliation: "Özyeğin University"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-30
license: Apache-2.0
url: "https://hidayeterenuludag.github.io/IHPSG13G2-LUT/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/hidayetErenUludag/IHPSG13G2-LUT"
abstract: >-
  Interactive gm/ID lookup tables and a MOSFET sizing calculator for the IHP SG13G2
  130 nm BiCMOS open-source PDK. Covers LV and HV NMOS/PMOS over channel length,
  VGS, VDS and finger width, generated from ngspice PSP103 operating-point sweeps
  and checked against direct simulation.
keywords:
  - gm/ID
  - lookup table
  - IHP SG13G2
  - open-source PDK
  - analog IC design
  - MOSFET sizing
  - ngspice
references:
  - type: conference-paper
    title: "Open-LUT: Interactive gm/ID Lookup Tables for MOSFET Sizing in Open-Source PDKs"
